   "The required-courses table prints 'Choose an Emphasis ... 3', but each emphasis says 'Complete 6 units' and the 24-unit total only adds up with 6 emphasis units (12 core + 6 emphasis + 6 electives). The 3 appears to be a catalog error; reviewer should check.",
